+                    "%.0f recorded | ms/frame: rf %.1f [gpuwait %.1f body %.1f tail %.1f] "
+                    "submit %.1f present %.1f nextwait %.1f | record %.1f clear %.1f "
+                    "flipcb %.1f bpresent %.1f | drain %.1f (%u passes, %.1f/frame; stop "
